# Check out text files with LF on every OS, so a build starts from the same bytes on Windows and on
# Linux (F-Droid). Assets and resources are packed byte for byte, so a text asset with CRLF line
# endings would otherwise make the APKs differ. (Kotlin already normalises line endings in strings.)
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jks binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary

# Windows batch files need CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
